WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:03.340
It wasn't a curse, it was a prayer!

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:06.840
If only you Newtypes hadn't come along!

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:10.260
As Banagher rushes toward
the final coordinates

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.840
indicated by the La+ Program,

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:14.510
his path is blocked by
a rampaging Riddhe Marcenas,

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:17.050
bound by a blood curse.

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:18.010
Ms. Marida!

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:19.880
I'll deal with this one.

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:22.090
You clear a path for the Nahel Argama!

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:23.260
Riddhe!

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:26.760
Mineva... You, too?

00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:29.470
Don't!

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:33.880
Riddhe has been swallowed by the machine.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:36.010
He's confronted by
a barrage of everyone's thoughts,

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:38.550
but is unable to gain control.

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:45.510
W-Wait!

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:50.550
What have... What have I done?

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:53.380
It's almost time.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:57.760
Grieving the loss of Marida,

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:00.260
Banagher and Mineva
head for the Vist mansion

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.760
inside the colony builder Magallanica.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.760
Whatever it is,

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:08.470
whatever is about to happen,

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:11.090
promise me.

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:13.930
Promise that you will come back to me.

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:18.680
It's in here.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:24.180
Laplace's Box has now been opened.

00:02:55.720 --> 00:03:00.510
(LAPLACE'S BOX)

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:03.340
Nahel Argama has dispatched
troops to target.

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:05.680
Appears to be holding position
and standing by.

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:08.800
Changes detected in centrifuge
habitat of target, Magallanica.

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:11.260
Relaying situation
information to Analysis.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:14.010
Neo Zeon fleet is hiding in shoal zone.

00:03:14.050 --> 00:03:16.510
Presuming that they are reorganizing
their remaining forces.

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:18.630
No change in trends observed.

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:25.630
The seal is breaking, eh?

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:56.220
It took a billion years
for the life that arose

00:03:56.260 --> 00:03:59.880
from the sea to crawl onto land.

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:05.220
Another billion years of
countless ups and downs

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:10.470
were then required for that
life to take human shape.

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:13.800
That is how evolution works.

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:17.050
It is not something that
can be discerned

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:20.050
within the limited lifespan
of an individual.

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:26.050
However, Newtypes represent an
expansion of cognitive ability.

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:30.880
One in which triggers the reformation
of an individual's consciousness.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:47.880
The final night of the old calendar.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:55.510
The instant the Universal Century
began, that is when it was woven.

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:04.050
The Universal Century Charter monument.

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:08.880
That monument, it- -

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:10.720
Look! Right there!

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:13.720
That's different from
the one we all know.

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:16.010
It has one extra article.

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:07.880
"In the future, should the emergence
of a new space-adapted human race

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:09.970
be confirmed, the Earth Federation
shall give priority

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:12.050
to involving them in the administration
of the government."

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:15.970
- A new human race...
- Newtypes?

00:06:16.010 --> 00:06:19.300
That is Laplace's Box.

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:31.680
The true form of the curse that has kept
us spellbound these long hundred years.

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:38.930
And it is also a prayer.

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:42.010
Ensign Riddhe.

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:44.300
Can you hear me? It's Otto.

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:46.880
Come back.

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:50.470
You're still a Nahel Argama crew member.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.930
Ensign Riddhe, this is Mihiro.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.970
If you can hear us, please respond.

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:56.220
Ensign Mihiro...

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.010
Captain Otto.

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:02.470
There was nothing I could do.

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:04.720
No, that's not true.

00:07:05.510 --> 00:07:08.380
There were countless other
paths I could have taken.

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:09.680
So why did I...?

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:12.380
Captain.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:15.050
Why do you suppose the Federation
has always been

00:07:15.090 --> 00:07:17.760
so scared of Zeon and tried
to prove it wrong?

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:20.970
The bunch of devils
who dropped a colony.

00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:24.930
That was the result, not the cause.

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:27.130
The real issue is Newtypes.

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:36.300
"In the future, should the emergence of a
new space-adapted human race be confirmed,

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:39.720
the Earth Federation shall give
priority to involving them

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:41.880
in the administration
of the government."

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:45.720
That prayer, woven a hundred years ago,

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:49.260
became a curse the instant
that Zeon Deikun

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:51.050
began proposing his Newtype theory...

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:53.010
Which means...

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:59.970
Ricardo Marcenas, the first prime minister,
added that passage entitled "Future"

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:04.180
as if to atone for discarding Earth's
excess population into space.

00:08:04.970 --> 00:08:06.130
But he...

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:09.510
He was made into a martyr to the
Federation political system.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:12.720
The Charter of the Universal
Century was rewritten,

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:14.880
and that should have
been the end of it.

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:20.050
If the genuine charter hadn't
fallen into the hands

00:08:20.090 --> 00:08:24.470
of Syam Vist, one of the terrorists
who carried out the assassination...

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:26.930
And as a result...

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:34.800
This is Syam Vist.

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:37.590
The founder of the Vist Foundation,

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:40.840
as well as your great-grandfather,
Master Banagher.

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:42.180
You were watching?

00:08:42.970 --> 00:08:45.930
Everything that's happened,
you were watching, but you- -

00:08:45.970 --> 00:08:47.130
Banagher.

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:52.720
Syam Vist.

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:54.800
For many years,

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:58.260
you have used this to extort
concessions from the Federation government.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:01.090
Why give that up now?

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:04.590
Four years from now,

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:12.510
in U.C. 0100, the autonomy of
the Republic of Zeon will be revoked.

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:18.880
The name of Zeon, along with his
ideology, will sink into oblivion.

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:24.720
The word "Newtype" will eventually
be forgotten as well,

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:28.930
and the curse of the Box
will return to nothingness.

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:30.930
As well as its prayer.

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:37.090
Without giving in to despair,
without trying to stymie it,

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:43.340
a prayer to turn back towards
the God called possibility.

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:45.970
If we miss this opportunity- -

00:09:46.220 --> 00:09:49.720
But if we do this,
war will break out again.

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:52.340
If it has been signed by
representatives of every nation,

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:55.680
this monument carries
the weight of law.

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:59.720
If an anti-government group like the Zeon
remnants were to get their hands on it,

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:02.380
it would be the perfect weapon
to bring down the Federation.

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:07.090
If that happens, it will be the
One Year War all over again.

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:11.470
It's too steep a price to pay
for the truth of their goodwill.

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:13.010
That is why

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:18.470
I want to entrust the matter
to Newtypes like you.

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:24.930
The La+ Program is a system designed
to identify true Newtypes.

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:27.300
Unlike those of Cyber-Newtypes,

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:31.220
the psycho-waves of true Newtypes
are beyond measurement.

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:35.840
That is the key that leads a true Newtype
to the Box, whoever that may be.

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:38.930
That is what the Unicorn Gundam is.

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:42.930
It was all planned by Cardeas Vist.

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:47.930
He never considered putting you
in it, not even in his dreams.

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:51.180
However, I am sure that he...

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:05.930
For something as trivial as that?

00:11:06.550 --> 00:11:09.430
He was a shrewd man.

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:13.300
Even as he blackmailed the government,
using the monument as leverage,

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:15.220
he never made unreasonable demands.

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:19.430
He fostered the development of
Anaheim Electronics, which was still

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:22.130
an up-and-comer at the time,
founded the Vist Foundation...

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:26.340
And its symbiotic relationship
with the Federation began.

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:28.800
A system maintained by

00:11:29.510 --> 00:11:33.880
hiding and revering the original
monument, Laplace's Box...

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:38.930
Whatever is actually in it
no longer matters.

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:43.050
The Box now symbolizes
the world's order.

00:11:45.840 --> 00:11:48.220
At first, it was nothing
more than a scandal

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:50.590
to threaten the
administration of the time.

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:54.260
But the Principality of Zeon's sudden
rise to power changed everything.

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:59.380
Whether or not Newtypes
really exist isn't the issue.

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:04.760
The very fact that the Federation
swept that article under the rug

00:12:05.090 --> 00:12:08.840
would become the ultimate weapon
for those who believe in Zeon.

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:11.550
They had no choice but to remain silent.

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:15.260
So that this world would
not be turned into Hell.

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:20.220
But in the end, Hell came anyway.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:21.930
The One Year War.

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:26.050
The sheer magnitude of the deaths

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:30.220
and the existence of Newtypes,
which had been proven by the war,

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:32.930
lent even more weight
to the Box's curse.

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:39.380
That's why my father and the others
had no choice but to keep the secret.

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:42.930
Out of fear that another war of
extermination would break out,

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:48.130
they chose the path of domesticating the
populace under a warped political system.

00:12:54.510 --> 00:12:58.260
But what's this "order" they've
tried so hard to protect?

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:04.220
I heard her... I definitely
heard Marida Cruz's voice.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:07.220
Until that instant, I didn't
even know her name.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.260
But I heard her voice.

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:12.260
We can understand each other.

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:15.260
Human beings have that
possibility within them.

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:17.550
Even as I said I was protecting her,

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:19.970
I didn't
believe in the person I was protecting.

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:23.380
I've let everyone down...

00:13:24.130 --> 00:13:27.260
And I've lost everything.

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:43.550
A direct hit?
That wasn't a ship's guns.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.930
A mobile suit?

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:47.260
Anti-air warning!

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:50.220
It might be Full Frontal!
Keep a sharp eye out!

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.010
Full Frontal...

00:14:05.310 --> 00:14:07.470
There is no cause for concern.

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:13.560
Magallanica was built tough
in anticipation of this day.

00:14:18.010 --> 00:14:21.220
It would seem that the black lion
has come to our aid, as well.

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:26.810
Anticipation of what day?

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:34.350
As I have spent these many years
as the Box's guardian,

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:37.760
staying too long in this body,

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:42.560
I have had but one desire.

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:47.930
If Newtypes truly existed,

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:51.350
I wanted to entrust the Box
to their care.

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:54.930
I believed that they would be able
to put the Box to better use

00:14:54.970 --> 00:14:59.560
and reclaim the future
that was meant to be.

00:15:02.390 --> 00:15:04.760
If technology was being perfected

00:15:04.810 --> 00:15:09.850
that could touch the
human psyche, the soul,

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:12.970
I wished to find out
if they truly did exist.

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:19.260
But that is my desire.

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:24.310
There are as many "my only desires"
as there are human beings.

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:30.680
You could leave the Box unopened,
or you could destroy it if you wished.

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:33.810
And if that alone would not satisfy you,

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:38.060
you are even welcome to
strike this old fool dead.

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:43.810
What do you desire?

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:47.310
What do you wish for in your heart?

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:54.060
If Newtypes are a new form of humanity,

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:58.470
I don't believe that current humans
would be able to identify them.

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:01.430
So I don't know if she and I

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:06.180
have the gifts you're looking for,

00:16:06.220 --> 00:16:09.100
and I don't know what's best
for everyone, either.

00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:11.430
But...

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:27.010
Even so...

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:31.760
As just one human being...
I want to believe in what lies ahead.

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:34.760
In people.

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:39.260
In the possibility that humanity possesses.

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:47.510
All is ready.

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:58.970
You are able to broadcast
to the entire Earth Sphere

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:02.760
via every communications
and broadcast system.

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:08.310
Even with all the power of the Foundation,
this was no small feat.

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:10.010
There is little time.

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:14.180
The Federation will do everything
in its power to stop you.

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:16.760
Now, hurry- -

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:21.470
I wouldn't do that if I were you.

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:30.310
This is actually an act of
locking possibility away.

00:17:32.220 --> 00:17:34.510
You should keep the contents
of the Box secret

00:17:35.930 --> 00:17:39.350
and use it as leverage to bargain
with the Federation.

00:17:39.890 --> 00:17:41.310
Frontal...

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:46.930
That is what will lead
Spacenoids to true prosperity.

00:18:25.140 --> 00:18:27.560
A new psycho-machine...

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:31.140
It's Full Frontal?

00:18:34.560 --> 00:18:36.640
Leave us, Full Frontal.

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:40.470
You're nothing but a man who
was made in Char's image

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:43.390
who is trying to fulfill his role.

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:47.430
Are you certain that this Side
Co-Prosperity Sphere you speak of

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:50.470
isn't just part of your programming?

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:54.140
A man who never believed in
humanity's future has no right to- -

00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:56.680
That may have been the case at first.

00:18:57.470 --> 00:19:00.390
But I am no longer empty.

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:05.350
It is not I who wished to come here
and see the true nature of the Box

00:19:05.390 --> 00:19:07.140
with his own eyes.

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:10.390
In truth, I do not know, either.

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:16.510
Whose thoughts are these that have been
poured into this artificial vessel?

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:23.010
Syam Vist,
patriarch of the Vist family.

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:29.850
As leader of Neo Zeon, as one
who speaks for all Spacenoids,

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:32.470
I would like you to place
Laplace's Box in my care.

00:19:35.390 --> 00:19:39.430
This is not a negotiation
conducted between proxies.

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:43.350
I ask that you do not interfere as you
did during the handover of the Key.

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:48.430
There is truth in what you say.

00:19:48.470 --> 00:19:52.010
It may be that the Box
should remain unopened

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:56.310
so that humanity may go on living in
the reality it has always known.

00:19:56.350 --> 00:19:59.060
- Then why- -
- That is exactly why.

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:03.560
The Box does not belong
in the hands of someone

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:08.640
who only views its opening
as a bargaining chip.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:11.810
The hands of men like you and me.

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:15.100
Hear me, Ghost of Char.

00:20:15.140 --> 00:20:19.890
The Universal Century will reach
the hundred year mark soon.

00:20:19.930 --> 00:20:23.350
This is no longer our time.

00:20:23.390 --> 00:20:26.140
Is it so unthinkable that
the time has come for us

00:20:26.180 --> 00:20:28.510
to turn over the reins to the children?

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:33.310
You believe that they are
true Newtypes, then?

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:36.560
That is of no consequence.

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:41.640
They followed the path that led to the
Box, and they have made their decision.

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:46.100
I intend to abide by that decision.

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:48.310
Very well.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:52.310
It is not my wish to engage
in further acts of war.

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:53.260
However...

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:56.760
If you cannot accept my request,

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:04.100
I will take the Charter of the
Universal Century by force.

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:17.060
He truly is a ghost...

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:19.640
Master Syam! Master Syam!
Are you safe?

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:20.600
I am.

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:23.640
We have been broken into by
an unknown psycho-machine.

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:26.810
Magallanica's systems
are being taken over.

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:29.600
Guard the communications
module with your life.

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:35.060
If that is destroyed, we will be unable
to broadcast to the entire Earth Sphere.

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:37.470
Without fail, sir.
But what about you?

00:21:37.510 --> 00:21:39.470
Never mind me.

00:21:39.510 --> 00:21:43.100
You are up against Full Frontal.
Don't let your guard down.

00:21:49.640 --> 00:21:51.180
Banagher!

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:55.010
I'll be back! Count on it!

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:41.640
Next time, on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn

00:23:41.680 --> 00:23:43.430
TO THE WORLD'S END

00:23:45.180 --> 00:23:48.560
awaken the Newtype that lies within you.
